{"job_id":"F-8779881aedbd950b85f7","family_id":"F-8779881aedbd950b85f7","title":"철도경찰직공무원 임용시험의 체력검사에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":26,"target_id":"5138afa22969510b18e0d03e6374d0296a61bee225bc94094fe7ec95d60a1285","source_hash":"31d1c8ee14ad83c2d924a4237b67aed9248747014e829ee14c91fc97ef905e26","text":"关于铁路警察人员任命考试体能测试的规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":114,"target_id":"60208962a0ddf80caec413edff1b28460de8c595f838addbf58d1a7b655e8858","source_hash":"6557dbadaf5d74a7c43e641d04b11a321615002d4d48ba7da4d136dc58ecea8d","text":"第一条（目的）本规则旨在规定根据《公务员聘任考试条例》第三条和第五条第四款规定，为铁路警察人员的聘任而进行的体能测试的相关事宜。<2014年10月13日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"BODY","start":114,"end":281,"target_id":"43443a654e2e5526007d7ddc04072226cac7f9a4f4968d75bc59ab0267c1146e","source_hash":"c644a5d70b0525ba8e0f49924a5364326ffe18ef201dd0e0d18804245ff46060","text":"第二条（体能测试对象）根据《公务员聘任考试条例》第二十四条、第二十九条和第三十七条的规定，铁路警察系列六级及以下公务员的公开竞争性招聘考试、专项招聘考试和调任考试，应当按照该条例第五条第四款的规定，进行体能测试，作为实际操作考试，以检验应聘者是否具备履行职责所需的体能。<2014年10月13日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"BODY","start":281,"end":391,"target_id":"bc35600039b4e37a5ec2f2f589d2d6abbd4b237464e45dc22d5b6d4e61e546cc","source_hash":"a335741435a6be15536598f901fa128240266085cc5c41ec1eae27b3f1c60f86","text":"第三条（体能测试项目及合格标准）\n① 根据第二条规定，体能测试的项目和合格标准如附表所示。\n② 体能测试结果应记录在所附的体能测试评估表上，并立即通知申请人。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"BODY","start":391,"end":412,"target_id":"956f9740b143fd8c11ba5bf03a0a1ec289aa2d417a064d5ade64c76a9ac7ce51","source_hash":"625353439e314dd845313611f541df1774a1c8e85bf852dacc2a1cee3a919f99","text":"补充规定 <第17号，2008年6月16日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"BODY","start":412,"end":448,"target_id":"251c5219e8276ec0293f92bc4b61ea59d6f299d025078d98d425ce7cf9edaa17","source_hash":"53052d208c204533532581bfd7a6e04a15ac8c57efb4df723ae9185d89443bb7","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自2009年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"BODY","start":448,"end":522,"target_id":"3799589f23e666568318040e6b2b26d60e7114d4530046109ff227e6290c87b3","source_hash":"73b6086fce3d5ea44e05a436537bd13e4a44c603e11f97e32e8ca01416a26778","text":"第二条（对正在进行的试验的过渡措施）本规则不适用于在本规则生效时已经公布或者正在进行的试验。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"BODY","start":522,"end":565,"target_id":"eff60b3d8ffd3c697b497982fb650ef2c0247ff0ba87e94f31bcf7c6a3b8ab21","source_hash":"7c33c11982e160726c809b32fc011fe318cadacaff7ccd55f5ca542dee82c415","text":"ADDEND（国土交通部及其附属机构组织结构实施细则）<2013年3月23日第1号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"BODY","start":565,"end":603,"target_id":"5b6680e59d85572604ec0546f1397f432d27f2a89f31c55e20b44cfca8f5ee31","source_hash":"17f62718ec8681372d471c3803ff3647ee41b5c21c983badb3168350a437f2a5","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"BODY","start":603,"end":620,"target_id":"465ca74ae7eff88b5556e705c31e9b4accc5ad490a170b372488ef2d3c91c1f7","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"BODY","start":620,"end":769,"target_id":"1d3b830ff1a746dd5cd147de3919807479f13ad983fcfa2fbaa765e7be38324f","source_hash":"17391ecfcae97960149452792f73bc0798e09ef38f38c9e83f7194b8947deb5e","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<101>款省略\n\n  <102> 铁路公安干部聘任考试体能测试规则部分修改如下。\n\n  在附表的注释 3 中，“国土交通海事部长”应改为“国土基础设施交通部长”。 \n\n  <103> 至 <126> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"BODY","start":769,"end":783,"target_id":"b9a8a2c00b044641ff93e59bdad61d96d9896c8d1fa36cc3dba5413eb8805708","source_hash":"b4e950e820d9a1afcf12aeb4aeda2f309f7331feb0b3a1dc81201ae853d636eb","text":"条款 7 和 8 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"BODY","start":783,"end":805,"target_id":"9136d07544433e17839fb96124616c772d1fb782b7c9aef02f3653e15bbfded4","source_hash":"55aa823260e5e154cb6cd8f61f557146741449b0cd7c756d2b14b6ee87aa6222","text":"补充规定 <第45号，2014年10月13日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"BODY","start":805,"end":835,"target_id":"2687ed4785fd8847db76c2316752251aa13745797361b2a2ae84683c0d60e4e7","source_hash":"0d63a18201aaf2f1d98d1a1c71f36ac02913f4fc2004246a24afe6bdd25c6c45","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"BODY","start":835,"end":2588,"target_id":"be5edbd039aa1d9f3ec6cf69a95d9ea5e5fbf7fd38f7e192fb1c4776d477f0e8","source_hash":"20a44afb5ac5bdeb6342436afbbbfe37f1853fe716b2b328e52d263bc1060f89","text":"第二条（体能测试合格标准的适用性）附件表格的修订规定适用于2016年1月1日或之后公布的测试。\n\n体能测试项目及合格标准（与第三条第一款相关）\n[附录] <修订于2014年10月13日>                                         \n\n  体能测试项目及合格标准（与第三条第一款相关）                      \n\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━┯━━┯━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n\n┃체력검사의 종목(측정 단위)│성별│합격기준                      ┃\n\n┠─────────────┼──┼───────────────┨\n\n┃20米折返跑（跑）│男子│42人或以上 ┃\n\n┃                          ├──┼───────────────┨\n\n┃ │女性│20 次或以上 ┃\n\n┠─────────────┼──┼───────────────┨\n\n┃윗몸일으키기(회/60초)     │남자│34회 이상                     ┃\n\n┃                          ├──┼───────────────┨\n\n┃ │女性│23 次或以上 ┃\n\n┠─────────────┼──┼───────────────┨\n\n┃악력(㎏)                  │남자│43.6㎏ 이상                   ┃\n\n┃                          ├──┼───────────────┨\n\n┃                          │여자│25.2㎏ 이상                   ┃\n\n┠─────────────┼──┼───────────────┨\n\n┃10미터 2회 왕복달리기(초) │남자│13.60초 미만                  ┃\n\n┃                          ├──┼───────────────┨\n\n┃                          │여자│16.21초 미만                  ┃\n\n┠─────────────┼──┼───────────────┨\n\n┃单腿站立，闭眼（秒）│男性│11.9秒或更久┃\n\n┃                          ├──┼───────────────┨\n\n┃                          │여자│8.5초 이상                    ┃\n\n┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━┷━━┷━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛\n\n  备注                                                              \n\n   1. 如果两门或两门以上科目未达到及格标准，考生将被视为不合格。   \n\n   2. 握力测量值四舍五入到小数点后两位   \n\n  发货高度，10米往返跑（两次）的测量值精确到小数点后三位      \n\n  以下的余数，单腿闭眼站立的测量值为十进制数      \n\n  计算结果保留两位小数。                             \n\n   3. 体能测试项目的具体测量方法由国土交通大臣确定。   \n\n  确定。\n\n体能测试评判表\n■ 铁路警察人员任命考试体能测试规则 [附件表格] <2014年10月13日修订>  \n\n"},{"id":"A36327-zh-00001","doc":"A36327","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2651128","source_hash":"4ebaf5613e220c6b1c6c6d9381518a5bd567defa4a2ac1e286c332187b309913","text":"[附录] <修订于2014年10月13日>"},{"id":"A36327-zh-00002","doc":"A36327","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2651129","source_hash":"2ac83319ea04b4b2b5d9d689731d4709d8b3e35c2a4e27b0cb5fc740687bdd6c","text":"体能测试项目及合格标准（与第三条第一款相关）"},{"id":"A36327-zh-00003","doc":"A36327","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2651130","source_hash":"a44d9775617573ccfc4b78edfc60483e728913ea93c1a576924c14b1a00dd63d","text":"体能测试项目（测量单位）"},{"id":"A36327-zh-00004","doc":"A36327","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2651131","source_hash":"b6eec4943f7543e84b6ca530139d0375c7f55f7dcc0a6296d22f770fa9bf05c0","text":"性别"},{"id":"A36327-zh-00005","doc":"A36327","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2651132","source_hash":"cbca9dcb8f3095fbbb5c2fc10ffdca1400a132cb8fa015bc899d1a20080b868b","text":"验收标准"},{"id":"A36327-zh-00006","doc":"A36327","law_id":"kr-010781-160424-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2651133","source_hash":"1267c1341c7740ed7a6aa6629a225e67cc33766a2b601198dc3b8553550d8da5","text":"20米折返跑（循环）"},{"id":"A36327-zh-00007","doc":"A36327","law_i